    {
      "id": "fr-sante-4",
      "title": "Chez le médecin",
      "subtitle": "At the doctor's and the chemist's",
      "topics": [
        "health"
      ],
      "words": [
        "health#doctor",
        "health#dentist",
        "health#prescription",
        "shopping#chemist's, pharmacy",
        "shopping#medicines"
      ],
      "learn": [
        {
          "title": "At the doctor's",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "textCols": [0],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "What's the matter?",
                  "Qu'est-ce qui ne va pas ?"
                ],
                [
                  "Since when?",
                  "Depuis quand ?"
                ],
                [
                  "Since yesterday.",
                  "Depuis hier."
                ],
                [
                  "I've had a fever for three days.",
                  "J'ai de la fièvre depuis trois jours."
                ],
                [
                  "Open your mouth.",
                  "Ouvrez la bouche."
                ],
                [
                  "Berte tento lék.",
                  "Prenez ce médicament."
                ],
                [
                  "three times a day",
                  "trois fois par jour"
                ],
                [
                  "Tady je recept.",
                  "Voici l'ordonnance."
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "You go to the doctor's *chez le médecin*, to the dentist's *chez le dentiste*: you go to people with *chez*."
            },
            {
              "type": "check",
              "item": {
                "type": "cloze",
                "fr": "J'ai mal à la gorge ___ hier.",
                "a": [
                  "depuis"
                ],
                "hint": "since, for"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "depuis + present tense",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "tip",
              "title": "depuis",
              "en": "Something that started in the past and is still going on is said in the **present tense** with *depuis*: *Je tousse depuis une semaine.* (I've been coughing for a week.) Not *j'ai toussé*."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "At the chemist's (*à la pharmacie*): *Je voudrais quelque chose contre la toux / contre le mal de tête.*"
            },
            {
              "type": "examples",
              "items": [
                {
                  "fr": "Bonjour docteur, j'ai mal au ventre.",
                  "en": "Hello, doctor, I have a stomach ache."
                },
                {
                  "fr": "Depuis quand ?",
                  "en": "Since when?"
                },
                {
                  "fr": "Depuis ce matin.",
                  "en": "Since this morning."
                },
                {
                  "fr": "Prenez ces comprimés deux fois par jour.",
                  "en": "Take these tablets twice a day."
                },
                {
                  "fr": "Je dois aller chez le dentiste.",
                  "en": "I have to go to the dentist."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "check",
              "item": {
                "type": "build",
                "en": "I've been coughing for a week.",
                "a": [
                  "Je tousse depuis une semaine."
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Words",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "vocab"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
